WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,660
Kaoshantun is located in the easternmost part of the town.

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,380
There are still more than ten kilometers away from the town

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,740
The town is no better than the county seat

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:10,420
No taxis or tricycles

5
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:12,580
If you're lucky, you can build two tractors

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:14,580
If you are unlucky, you will have to walk.

7
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:20,140
Brother, fourth uncle, it’s me, Yaqin.

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:23,530
Yaqin, why are you back?

9
00:00:23,530 --> 00:00:26,110
This is the sun coming out in the west

10
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:28,030
Zhang Jianguo is a scumbag that everyone calls for beating.

11
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,910
He actually accompanied Yaqin back to her parents' home

12
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,890
Zhang Jianguo, why are you here too, uncle?

13
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:35,250
Isn’t this Yaqin missing her mother’s family?

14
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,690
I'll come back with her to see, right?

15
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,820
That's really rare

16
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:41,340
It's really rare to come here

17
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,940
So this time I give it to my uncle

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,340
I brought a lot of good things

19
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:45,980
Fourth uncle, please keep this cigarette

20
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,580
Make up single card

21
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,820
These are state factory workers

22
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,180
It’s a good cigarette that I’m willing to smoke

23
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,660
Could it be that this guy has really changed his gender?

24
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,780
I want to live a good life with Yaqin

25
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,260
Get in the car and I'll take you there
